# ============================================================
# Chatimall — ROOT META REPO (architecture docs + deploy blueprints only)
#
# The three deployable pieces each live in THEIR OWN independent repos:
#   frontend/          → https://github.com/YOURNAME/chatimall-frontend          → Vercel
#   BACKEND/           → https://github.com/YOURNAME/chatimall-backend           → Render
#   translate-service/ → https://github.com/YOURNAME/chatimall-translate-service → its own server (needs RAM)
#
# Those three folders are git repos in their own right (each has its own .git/).
# This root meta-repo keeps only the cross-cutting files: README, original
# architecture notes, Render blueprint YAML, helper tools.
# ============================================================

# ---------- The three deployable repos — each has its own .git ----------
frontend/
BACKEND/
translate-service/

